samples/Maker:
==============

This directory contains two example classes.  The first is from the
Objective-C book by Dr. Brad Cox, chapter 6.  The dependency graph
example can read a file, or generate a sample internally.  The other
example is a cute "hello world" program that uses a class that has
one method in it, strReverse.  These are good places to start from.

--- brian witt, 18-April-90
